2026-11-07T06:56:27.9385280Z 
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9385590Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9386100Z 
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9386970Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9387510Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9388010Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9388420Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9388850Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9389180Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9389740Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9390130Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9416420Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9416880Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9457760Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9458820Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9459680Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:56:27.9460480Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
